00:28:09,480 --> 00:28:10,530
我是有意识的
"I am conscious.

532
00:28:10,650 --> 00:28:15,810
于是 意识决定了存在
Therefore,consciousness determines existence."

533
00:28:15,920 --> 00:28:17,970
对此 爱因斯坦曾暴跳如雷
At that point,Einstein went ballistic

534
00:28:18,090 --> 00:28:19,410
说 什么？
and said,"what?

535
00:28:19,520 --> 00:28:21,840
你是说事实上是你的意识
"You're saying that the fact that you are a conscious being

