00:28:21,960 --> 00:28:24,680
决定了猫活着的事实？
determines the fact that the cat is alive?"

537
00:28:24,790 --> 00:28:27,880
答案是肯定的 威格纳又推进了一步
The answer is yes,and Wigner made one more step.

538
00:28:28,000 --> 00:28:30,550
那就是 我是如何知道自己活着的呢？
And that is,"How do I know I'm alive?"

539
00:28:30,670 --> 00:28:34,190
你瞧 猫和我 我们属于同一个宇宙
You see,the cat and me,we're part of the same universe.

540
00:28:34,300 --> 00:28:36,960
如果我不知道猫是死是活
If I don't know the cat is alive or dead,

541
00:28:37,070 --> 00:28:39,530
那我也可能在同一时刻死去了
I could also be dead at the same time

542
00:28:39,640 --> 00:28:40,960
甚至都不知道它了
and not even know it.

543
00:28:41,080 --> 00:28:43,830
所以 谁决定了我的活着呢？
So,who determines that I'm alive?

544
00:28:43,940 --> 00:28:46,670
啊 威格纳的朋友看到我
Well,Wigner's friend looks at me,

545
00:28:46,780 --> 00:28:48,200
我看到猫
I look at the cat,

546
00:28:48,310 --> 00:28:49,310
我们存在着
and we exist.

547
00:28:49,420 --> 00:28:52,140
不过又是谁看到威格纳的朋友的呢？
But then who looks at Wigner's friend?

548
00:28:52,250 --> 00:28:55,480
有无限长串的人在看
And there's an infinite chain of people looking at people

549
00:28:55,590 --> 00:28:56,710
看到了别人的人
looking at people

550
00:28:56,820 --> 00:29:02,720
直到最后 你撞上了宇宙意识
