551
00:29:02,830 --> 00:29:05,720
有些意识很虚幻
Some consciousness that's ethereal,

552
00:29:05,830 --> 00:29:07,890
笼罩着宇宙
that envelops the Universe,

553
00:29:08,000 --> 00:29:12,060
