601
00:31:48,530 --> 00:31:51,880
它是宇宙基本结构的
Something that's part of the very fabric

602
00:31:52,000 --> 00:31:53,380
组成部分么？
of the Universe?

603
00:31:53,500 --> 00:31:55,750
此人认为就是
This man believes it is.

604
