615
00:32:33,460 --> 00:32:37,220
它们可能来自你的第六感
They could be coming from your sixth sense.

616
00:32:41,300 --> 00:32:44,390
迪安.雷丁，资深科学家
Dean Radin,a senior scientist

617
00:32:44,500 --> 00:32:47,760
任职于智力科学研究院
at the Institute for Noetic Science,

618
00:32:47,870 --> 00:32:50,690
