00:32:53,280 --> 00:32:54,930
有过经历 他们可能称为是
have an experience that they might call

621
00:32:55,040 --> 00:32:56,680
直观的预感或直觉
an intuitive hunch or a gut feeling.

622
00:32:58,790 --> 00:33:00,750
典型的案例就是驾车上路
A prototypical case is driving down the road

623
00:33:00,860 --> 00:33:02,220
你来到交叉路口
and you're coming to an intersection,

624
00:33:02,330 --> 00:33:06,260
你有个不祥之感 所以就放慢了速度
and you just get a bad feeling,so you slow down.

625
00:33:06,370 --> 00:33:08,040
某种怪异的感觉
Something feels spooky.

626
00:33:11,180 --> 00:33:13,300
卡车闯红灯
And a truck goes through the red light

627
00:33:13,410 --> 00:33:16,500
会拦腰装上你 如果你不放慢速度的话
and would've hit you broadside if you had not slowed down.

628
00:33:16,840 --> 00:33:18,390
那是怎么回事？
But what is that?

629
00:33:18,500 --> 00:33:20,800
有时这是巧合
Sometimes it's coincidence.

630
00:33:20,910 --> 00:33:23,500
有时人们会无中生有
Sometimes people make up things.

631
00:33:23,610 --> 00:33:24,800
预感实验
The presentiment experiment

632
00:33:24,910 --> 00:33:27,070
不管怎样就是观察 原则上
is a way of seeing whether or not,in principle,

633
00:33:27,180 --> 00:33:28,870
有时其实是因为
that sometimes it's actually because

634
00:33:28,980 --> 00:33:31,370
你得到了你的未来 你未来的体验
you're getting your future -- your future experience.

635
00:33:31,490 --> 00:33:32,640
抬起你的手臂
You put your arm up.

636
00:33:32,750 --> 00:33:35,380
弗里曼：迪安开发了一个科学手段
Dean has developed a scientific method

637
00:33:35,490 --> 00:33:38,270
来测试人们是否真能预见
to test whether people can really anticipate events

638
00:33:38,390 --> 00:33:39,390
未来的事件 -
in the future --

639
00:33:39,500 --> 00:33:43,930
他称之为预感的能力
an ability he calls presentiment.

640
00:33:45,800 --> 00:33:49,120
今天 他的伙伴是志愿者珍妮特
Today,he's working with a volunteer,Janet.

641
00:33:49,240 --> 00:33:51,190
好嘞 放轻松 谢谢
Okay,have fun. Thanks.

642
00:33:51,310 --> 00:33:55,330
