645
00:34:01,780 --> 00:34:06,340
她观看的是一系列随机的照片 -
What she looks at are a randomized series of photos --

646
00:34:06,450 --> 00:34:08,540
有平淡的
some bland,

647
00:34:08,660 --> 00:34:10,590
有激情的
some emotionally charged.

648
00:34:14,460 --> 00:34:17,520
迪安跟踪珍妮特的皮肤导体
Dean charts Janet's skin conductors,

649
00:34:17,630 --> 00:34:20,020
测量她的紧张程度
a measure of her stress level,

650
00:34:20,130 --> 00:34:22,020
对应她所观看的图片类型
against the types of images she was seeing.

651
00:34:22,140 --> 00:34:26,960
迪安和其它人的心理研究
What Dean and any other psychological research

652
00:34:27,070 --> 00:34:28,860
所期望发现的
should expect to find

653
00:34:28,980 --> 00:34:31,030
是看到刺激情感图片后
is a sharp change in the response

654
00:34:31,150 --> 00:34:33,750
反应的剧烈变化
right after an emotionally jarring image.

655
00:34:34,980 --> 00:34:39,140
但是那并不是他所发现的
But that's not what he finds.

656
00:34:39,250 --> 00:34:42,340
迪安：这条线表示图片的实际出现
This line shows where the actual picture shows up.

657
00:34:42,460 --> 00:34:44,510
所以如果这张图片出现在这里
So if this picture shows up here,

658
00:34:44,630 --> 00:34:46,980
你就会觉得此处不应该
you would think that there shouldn't be

659
00:34:47,090 --> 00:34:48,920
有别于激情图片的
any difference in the overall average

660
00:34:49,030 --> 00:34:50,190
整体平均水平
of the emotional pictures

661
00:34:50,300 --> 00:34:52,290
及平淡图片的整体平均水平
and overall average of the calm pictures.

662
00:34:52,400 --> 00:34:55,060
但是她看到激情图片后 就有了一个突然升高
But when she sees an emotional picture,there's a bump up.

663
00:34:55,170 --> 00:34:58,230
所以 现在我们回到之前的5秒钟
So,now we go backwards in time five seconds before,

664
00:34:58,340 --> 00:35:00,030
我们能够看到从那时起
and we can see that from that moment

665
00:35:00,140 --> 00:35:02,260
如果下来会是激情的图片
that if it's going to be an emotional picture,

666
00:35:02,380 --> 00:35:06,130
她就已经出现相对平淡图片的情绪了
she's already becoming emotional as compared to the calm.

667
00:35:06,250 --> 00:35:09,910
此种差异就是我所谓的预感响应
This difference is what I call a presentiment response.

668
00:35:10,020 --> 00:35:13,140
弗里曼：根据迪安的研究
According to Dean's research,

669
00:35:13,260 --> 00:35:16,050
珍妮特身体对图片的反应
Janet's body is responding to the pictures

670
00:35:16,160 --> 00:35:18,430
早于她眼见之前5秒钟
five seconds before she sees them.

671
00:35:19,690 --> 00:35:24,150
同样的效果 出现在他过去30年的
It's the same effect he's found in hundreds of trials

672
00:35:24,270 --> 00:35:25,650
数百次测试中
over the past 30 years.

673
00:35:25,770 --> 00:35:29,160
他的整个课题都表现了这种预感反应
All of his subjects show this presentiment response.

674
00:35:29,270 --> 00:35:32,160
雷丁：它表现出的仿佛信息
It appears as though the information

675
00:35:32,270 --> 00:35:33,900
在时间上往后泄露
is leaking backwards in time.

676
00:35:34,010 --> 00:35:35,730
这个实验所标明的
What this experiment suggests

677
00:35:35,840 --> 00:35:38,300
是某种预期效果
is that there's some kind of anticipatory effect

678
00:35:38,410 --> 00:35:39,500
有5秒钟
that's five seconds.

679
00:35:39,620 --> 00:35:41,300
我们不知道其极限是多少
We don't know what the limit is.

680
00:35:41,420 --> 00:35:46,470
弗里曼：如果我们的心智真能洞察未来…
If our minds really can see into the future...

681
00:35:46,590 --> 00:35:49,620
我们能否科学地解释它呢？
How can we explain it scientifically?

682
00:35:51,740 --> 00:35:54,840
道来：在19世纪60年代美国内战期间
In the 1860s,during the time of the American Civil War,

683
00:35:54,960 --> 00:35:56,950
英国物理学家詹姆斯.克拉克.麦克斯韦
physicist James Clerk Maxwell in England

684
00:35:57,060 --> 00:36:02,730
研究出了光电磁的整个理论
worked out the entire theory of light and electromagnetism.

685
00:36:03,480 --> 00:36:06,230
麦克斯韦指出光
What Maxwell showed is that light,

686
00:36:06,340 --> 00:36:10,000
弥漫在我们宇宙间的这种神秘之物
this mysterious thing that pervades our Universe,

687
00:36:10,010 --> 00:36:10,720
其实是一种波
is actually a wave.

688
00:36:10,840 --> 00:36:12,960
我们现在知道光无非就是一种
So we now know that light is nothing but a wave

689
00:36:13,070 --> 00:36:16,810
电磁在一起震荡的波
of electricity and magnetism oscillating together.

690
00:36:19,270 --> 00:36:23,100
想象一个舞者挥舞着大旗
Think of a dancer waving this gigantic flag.

691
00:36:23,110 --> 00:36:24,500
先是手动起来
The hand motion comes first,

692
00:36:24,610 --> 00:36:27,540
然后挥舞舒展开来
and then the wave starts to unfurl.

693
00:36:27,990 --> 00:36:31,010
不过让我来告诉你其中一个见不得人的小秘密
But let me let you in on a dirty little secret.

694
00:36:31,130 --> 00:36:35,920
麦克斯韦方程式有第二个解答
There is a second solution to Maxwell's equation

695
00:36:36,030 --> 00:36:40,820
困扰了物理界长达150年
that has haunted physics for the last 150 years.

696
00:36:40,940 --> 00:36:43,290
还存在这些怪异的超前波 -
There are also these bizarre advanced waves --

697
00:36:43,410 --> 00:36:45,900
让你看到未来的解决方案
solutions that allow you to see the future.

698
00:36:46,010 --> 00:36:49,230
弗里曼：在超前波解决方案里
In the advanced wave solution,

699
00:36:49,350 --> 00:36:52,670
旗帜的动作先于舞者的手
the flag moves before the dancer's hand.

700
00:36:52,780 --> 00:36:56,070
信息从未来传送到现在
Information travels from the future to the present.

701
00:36:56,190 --> 00:36:59,880
那么 这个替代方案能够
So,could this alternate solution

702
00:36:59,990 --> 00:37:01,750
作为物理基本定律之一
to one of the basic laws of physics

703
00:37:01,860 --> 00:37:05,150
来解释迪安.雷丁的成果吗？
explain Dean Radin's results?

